            "review_title": "Review at DESTINY Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Phạm T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12 contributions\n0\nHONGKONG COCKTAIL BAR WITH THE BUS STATION\nJul 2023 • Friends\nThere is no doubt that it is a perfect destination for friend bonding. I came to this bar in a late night, its about Hongkong vibe and exactly impressed me by the Hongkong bus station. I rcm u My Destiny cocktail or 10,000 years cocktail. Fingerfood was ok. I personally found its atmosphere suitable for couple or friends bonding.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 19, 2023",
