            "review_text": "KUNE NGUYEN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nHong Kong Vibes in the Heart of Saigon\nMay 2023 • Friends\nI came here when the restaurant had just opened, so it was still empty. But that didn't make me feel lonely because the atmosphere here is truly cozy. Besides the Asian-inspired dishes, there are also drinks that perfectly match my taste buds. I came here with a group of friends, so the only downside was that the table was a bit small to accommodate all the dishes we ordered.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 19, 2023",
