            "review_text": "Excursion61453605927\n1 contribution\n0\nperfect experience for anyone looking for a calm and chill place for a drink.\nJul 2023 • Friends\nvisited destiny a few times. it's the perfect chill spot with aesthetic vibes. every corner is a picture perfect spot. their food is delicious as well with a lot of variety to fit your taste. the staff is also warm and welcoming. honestly i'm a very picky person when going to cocktail bars but i love my experience with destiny.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 17, 2023",
